1
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,820
Hmm, where's Kazuto?

2
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,937
He should have shown up by now.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,797
Maybe they don't have all the
battles up on the feet yet.

4
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,360
I mean, knowing Kirito,

5
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,097
we should have seen him running
around guns blazing from the start.

6
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,340
I don't know.

7
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:27,057
He's one of the craftiest
players I've ever met.

8
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,897
He's probably laying low somewhere waiting

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,509
for the competition to
kill each other off.

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,150
Oh, please.

11
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,497
You and I both know he
doesn't play like that.

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,874
Isn't that right, Yui?

13
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:37,990
Absolutely.

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,377
Besides that, he's so fast, I
doubt he'll even show up on camera.

15
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,957
He'll sneak up and strike before
his enemy knows what's happening.

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,900
He can't do it any other way.

17
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,657
I mean, it's a game with
guns and he's using a sword.

18
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:50,799
What a dupe thing.

19
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,320
He's kind of a dork.

20
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,680
That one guy's unbelievable.

21
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,260
You mean the one in white?

22
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,960
Oh, he's super fast.

23
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:32,100
Yeah, that guy's sick.

24
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,399
I bet he's going to win this thing.

25
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,693
Looks like your boy's full of suck, Liz.

26
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,840
Shut up, he's not out of it yet.

27
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,740
What happened to him?

28
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:50,537
It's some kind of paralysis attack.

29
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,120
Most likely temporary.

30
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:57,120
It's like he was hit with
that wind spell, Thunderweb.

31
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,550
Oh,

32
00:02:21,973 --> 00:02:22,803
oh, oh, oh,

33
00:02:22,886 --> 00:02:23,716
oh,

34
00:02:23,799 --> 00:02:24,629
oh

35
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:47,620
Let's go.

36
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,920
Oh

37
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,620
Xenon, shoot! Huh? Which one?

38
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,409
It's the guy in the cloak!

39
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,997
There's no time, shoot him!

40
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:19,910
Hurry!

41
00:04:19,993 --> 00:04:21,327
Don't let him fire that gun!

42
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:36,660
Oh crap, he knew I was here.

43
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,560
How could he?

44
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:42,760
Maybe he spotted me earlier, got
my position from the last scan.

45
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,240
Oh, my God.

46
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,120
Jesus, what was that?

47
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:49,240
Death Gun is my name,
and the name of my gun.

48
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:58,357
One day I'll pay you all
a visit too and bring

49
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:04,077
real death with this gun
you've seen my power.

50
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:09,817
It is real this isn't over not yet

51
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:16,800
I'm just getting started it's showtime!

52
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:24,140
I've met that person before, but where?

53
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,398
There's only one place I could have.

54
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:29,450
Heingrad.

55
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,955
Way to scare the hell out of everyone.

56
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:38,740
You gotta be kidding me. No way. Can't be.

57
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,320
You know him too?

58
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,071
Do you remember his name?

59
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:43,210
No.

60
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:46,340
I forget the handle he used, but it's him.

61
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,640
There's no doubt.

62
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,840
He was in Laughing Coffin.

63
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:54,620
Laughing Coffin.

64
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:56,760
Was he their leader?

65
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,767
You know, the knife wielder?

66
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,150
No.

67
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,889
Pretty sure it's not Pooh.

68
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:05,648
Something about the way this
guy talks and acts is different.

69
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:08,620
Except for that show timeline, though.

70
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,618
Pooh was the only one who said that.

71
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:14,440
But this guy, he was close to Pooh.

72
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,501
I'm talking right-hand man close.

73
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,950
Kirito.

74
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:24,977
It's him all right.

75
00:07:25,060 --> 00:07:26,137
Oh yeah.

76
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:27,357
That's death gun.

77
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,457
Death gun.

78
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,777
You're joking.

79
00:07:29,860 --> 00:07:33,277
You mean those rumors about players
getting shot and disappearing?

80
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,597
Those are all true. Yeah. They are.

81
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,457
I don't know how he does it yet.

82
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:40,057
But he's been killing
players in the real world.

83
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:41,497
That's insane.

84
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:43,497
It's not two people have.

85
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:45,051
He's been confirmed dead.

86
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,560
Where'd he go?

87
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,417
Kirito, watch the bridge for a sec.

88
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:11,917
I'm gonna check the scan and
see what Nimi's going by.

89
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,160
Yeah, you got it.

90
00:08:27,620 --> 00:08:28,450
Huh?

91
00:08:28,533 --> 00:08:29,363
Where is he?

92
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:31,785
Could he have moved that fast?

93
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,010
No.

94
00:08:35,093 --> 00:08:35,923
This is our chance.

95
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:37,640
For what?

96
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,057
Your pal in the cloak isn't
showing up on the terminal.

97
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:42,540
My guess is he jumped in the river.

98
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:46,231
If I'm right, then he had to
disable his gear like you did.

99
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,033
What about his handgun?

100
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:50,897
He can still move underwater
with that equipped, right?

101
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:53,297
Even if he could, it's
just one little handgun.

102
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,777
I could take him out easy with my hand.

103
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:55,690
You can't!

104
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,894
You saw what happened.

105
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:00,609
He used that little
gun to kill Pale Rider.

106
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:03,560
All it takes is one shot. Get it?

107
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,720
One shot and you're dead for real!

108
00:09:07,740 --> 00:09:11,577
Yeah well I'm not buying it how is it even

109
00:09:11,660 --> 00:09:15,300
possible i mean a player
killing people iRL

110
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:19,557
I know it sounds crazy but it's the truth

111
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:22,657
this death gun guy
killed a lot of people in

112
00:09:22,740 --> 00:09:26,017
that VR MMO I was in
when he used his sword

113
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:29,000
on someone he knew he
was really killing them

114
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:33,200
And so did I.

115
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:40,680
There's a killer, a murderer, in GGO.

116
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:53,917
Xenon!

117
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,120
Xenon!

118
00:09:59,080 --> 00:09:59,910
I'm alright.

119
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,809
Just a little freaked out.

120
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:06,308
Anyway, I'm still not convinced
what you told me is possible.

121
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:09,497
But I don't think you're
lying to me about it either.

122
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:10,577
That's good enough.

123
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:11,895
I can't ask for more.

124
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:15,960
Yeah, well, we better
get out of the area ASAP.

125
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,197
The others know we're here by now.

126
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:23,574
They think we're busy fighting each
other, so they'll be closing in soon.

127
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:24,630
You got a point.

128
00:10:24,713 --> 00:10:26,091
We'll split up here then.

129
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,967
Wait, what are you gonna do?

130
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,520
I'm going after Death Gun, alone.

131
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,520
Whatever you do, stay away from him.

132
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:35,460
I'll keep my promise.

133
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:38,657
Next time we see each other, I'll
give you the fight I owe you.

134
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:40,100
Oh, and one more thing.

135
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:43,732
Thanks for hearing me out just
now instead of shooting me.

136
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:47,010
Hey!

137
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,580
Wait for me!

138
00:10:56,580 --> 00:10:58,580
I'm coming with you. What?

139
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:01,275
That Death Gun guy seems pretty tough.

140
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:04,520
And if he kills you, you
won't be able to fight me.

141
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:05,797
I don't think you get out.

142
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,710
Look,

143
00:11:06,793 --> 00:11:07,657
I'm not a fan of teaming up either,

144
00:11:07,740 --> 00:11:09,597
but I think we stand a
better chance of knocking

145
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,327
that guy out of the game
if we work together.

146
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,417
No, I'm not down with that.

147
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:15,618
It's too dangerous.

148
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,605
We don't have any idea
where he'll pop up next.

149
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:21,859
So it'll be dangerous whether
we're together or not.

150
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,637
We better take care of this, Joker.

151
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:49,544
I'll block his bullets,
you wait for an opening.

152
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,150
Roger that.

153
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:08,080
It's all yours!

154
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,200
No way!

155
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:38,957
Death Gun's probably
heading north of the river.

156
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:43,057
I want to be there when he surfaces,
but I don't know where he'll stop.

157
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,480
Got any ideas, Sinon?

158
00:12:48,020 --> 00:12:50,817
I don't know if he's got
any other special skills,

159
00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:52,977
but from what I've seen, he's a sniper.

160
00:12:53,060 --> 00:12:56,825
He's going to avoid open spaces
and look for a place with cover.

161
00:12:57,520 --> 00:13:00,991
If I were him, I'd set myself
up in the ruins of that city.

162
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:02,610
Good.

163
00:13:02,693 --> 00:13:05,011
Then that's where you and me are gonna go.

164
00:13:07,540 --> 00:13:08,400
On your six.

165
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:25,560
In SAO, we had a code.

166
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:30,000
Never let another player's
HP hit zero, no matter what.

167
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:34,280
We knew, if it dropped to
nothing, that player would die.

168
00:13:36,260 --> 00:13:38,100
Laughing Coffin didn't care.

169
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:41,540
They killed dozens,
no, hundreds of people.

170
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:44,100
The assault team had to step in.

171
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:49,060
They put a party together to
hunt him down, and capture them.

172
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:52,840
And Kazuto was there with you?

173
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:54,970
Yeah.

174
00:13:55,053 --> 00:13:56,777
He was up front, going toe-to-toe.

175
00:13:56,860 --> 00:13:58,978
Everything went to hell pretty fast.

176
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:03,140
Oh man, that's why Kazuto's
been acting so weird lately.

177
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,660
Now I'm worried.

178
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:07,997
Maybe he's trying to settle
some grudge or something.

179
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:08,910
Grudge?

180
00:14:08,993 --> 00:14:11,451
Isn't this supposed to be a part-time job?

181
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:15,220
Sorry, I'm logging out for a bit. Why?

182
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:17,937
I have to get in touch
with Kirito's client.

183
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:20,200
Wait, he's got a client? Mm-hmm.

184
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:23,247
He's the one who got
Kirito to dive into GGO.

185
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:25,180
I bet he knows what's going on.

186
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:26,990
Oh, and Yui?

187
00:14:27,073 --> 00:14:29,057
I'm going to need your
help while I'm gone.

188
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:31,380
Find out anything you can about GGO.

189
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,360
You can count on me, Mommy!

190
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:35,837
I'll be back in a little while.

191
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:36,750
Wish me luck.

192
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,831
Where the heck did he go?

193
00:14:57,860 --> 00:15:00,477
You think we might have passed
him on the way over here?

194
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,940
No, we didn't pass him.

195
00:15:02,140 --> 00:15:05,797
I was keeping an eye on the river
the whole time we were running.

196
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:06,710
Oh.

197
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,904
Well, the river dead ends here.

198
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,849
I guess he must be lurking
around somewhere in the city now.

199
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,550
Okay.

200
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:15,570
Listen.

201
00:15:15,653 --> 00:15:17,777
When his location pops
up in the next scan,

202
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:20,566
We'll rush him before
he can kill anyone else.

203
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:21,940
I'm done with that.

204
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,852
But there's one problem.

205
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,380
How will we know who Death Gun is?

206
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:29,442
I mean, that's not his
avatar's handle, remember?

207
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,540
Oh, yeah, right.

208
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:34,519
Then let's start with what we know.

209
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:37,837
You said you didn't recognize
the names of three new players.

210
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:40,320
It's not Pale Rider, that's for sure.

211
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:44,337
That leaves us with two names
in play that could be Death Gun.

212
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:46,040
Jushi X and Sterben.

213
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:50,860
If they're both in this city, we
can't afford to pick the wrong one.

214
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:53,000
Wait a sec.

215
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,007
I just thought of something.

216
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:59,120
In Japanese, the Shi in
Jushi means death. Get it?

217
00:15:59,340 --> 00:16:01,140
And the X could mean cross.

218
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:03,097
Like making the sign of the cross.

219
00:16:03,180 --> 00:16:04,010
You think?

220
00:16:04,093 --> 00:16:05,540
Or maybe it's too obvious.

221
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,310
Maybe not.

222
00:16:08,393 --> 00:16:11,125
Aren't Avatar names
usually simple and obvious?

223
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:14,440
Mine's a variation on
my real name. And yours?

224
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,380
Yeah, same here.

225
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:24,200
Well, if they're both here,
we'll go after Jushie X first.

226
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:28,060
Oh, and if I get paralyzed
like Pale Rider, don't panic.

227
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,977
Get into position and wait.

228
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:30,890
Huh?

229
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,917
Deathgun's probably
hiding somewhere close.

230
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:36,647
When he comes out to finish me
off, that's when you shoot him.

231
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:40,034
Aren't you worried I'll shoot you, too?

232
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,161
Are you kidding?

233
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:44,575
You're the last person I'd
expect to play it like that.

234
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:45,759
Let's go, partner.

235
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,260
I'm counting on you.

236
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:00,128
Okay, but once we get
him, all bets are off!

237
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:15,193
Kirito, check the north side of the map.

238
00:17:22,940 --> 00:17:23,770
It's him.

239
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:26,377
He's the only one in the city.

240
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:27,837
I guess he's our man, huh?

241
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,861
Yeah, I don't see Sterben around.

242
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:30,857
That settles it.

243
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:33,157
Jushi-X and Death Gun are one in the same.

244
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,600
That means he's going after... him.

245
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:38,400
We better move fast.

246
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:40,720
Rikoko's almost in range. Yeah.

247
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,237
Are you ready for this?

248
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,150
Yep.

249
00:18:11,620 --> 00:18:13,140
Found him. Up there.

250
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:17,457
He's probably waiting for Rikoko
to walk right up into his sights.

251
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:20,677
I'll attack Jushi-X from
behind while I got the chance.

252
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:22,577
That building in front
of the stadium might

253
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:24,937
be a good place for you
to get into position.

254
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,880
No, I'm coming with you.

255
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:28,280
Not this time.

256
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:31,305
I can fight way better
knowing you got my back.

257
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:32,913
We're a team, remember?

258
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,310
Mm-hmm.

259
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:41,757
All I'm gonna need is 30 seconds to get up
there and I'll be ready to take him out.

260
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,487
Is that enough time for you?

261
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:47,180
Mm-hmm. Plenty. Cool. See you in a bit.

262
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:08,640
As soon as Death Gun's gone,
we'll be enemies again.

263
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:14,640
I'll shoot him, beat
him, and then forget him.

264
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:16,870
Whatever.

265
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:20,002
It's not like I'll ever
see him again after this.

266
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:29,940
What?

267
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,217
But...

268
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:41,060
Death Gun's supposed to be in the stadium!

269
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:09,660
Kirito,

270
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:16,480
wherever you are, it's time I found out
if you were the real deal or a fake.

271
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:24,037
I remember how you fought
back then, all fury and rage.

272
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:30,160
If I kill this friend of yours and
you go berserk like I remember,

273
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,440
I'll know it's really you.

274
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:36,060
He's gotta kill me?

275
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,560
Come on, Kirito.

276
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:41,960
Show me.

277
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:48,920
Let's see your fury, your
rage, your insane sword.

278
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:52,860
Show me for old time's sake.

279
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:11,380
I type 54, Blackstar.

280
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:21,980
It's the gun.

281
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:25,690
Why?

282
00:21:25,773 --> 00:21:26,800
Why here?

283
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:29,160
Why does he have that gun?

284
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:54,950
Ah!

285
00:22:05,320 --> 00:22:09,060
I want to be stronger, so strong.

286
00:22:10,020 --> 00:22:12,477
I want to be stronger,
so I want to be stronger.

287
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:13,854
I want to be more sad.

288
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:27,020
I've never seen a change in my past.

289
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:30,500
I've never seen a way.

290
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:34,977
I've never seen any of my wounds.

291
00:22:35,060 --> 00:22:37,580
I've never seen a long time.

292
00:22:39,120 --> 00:22:41,217
I've never seen this pain.

293
00:22:41,300 --> 00:22:43,797
I can't do it alone.

294
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:47,877
I don't need one more.

295
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:51,480
I don't need one more.

296
00:23:20,060 --> 00:23:21,460
Let's go.

297
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:38,500
Next time, Death Chaser.
